        "randomness": 30,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Ngh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected Patrol Unit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "I didn't cut off your hands! Pick yourself up!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_082"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Don't you dare think this is over!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected Patrol Unit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll cut out your tongue right here, then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_082"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.4,
        "xstrength": 0,
        "ystrength": 8,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 30,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Eek!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected Patrol Unit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 0.9
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$drift_intro",
        "key": "$drift_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Off he goes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you oka\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_092#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "What have you done! Oh, God, Talulah... Look at what you've done!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "Talulah, we'll have to transport the village in two days. Just look at what you've...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "You fought a patrolman! There'll be hell to pay now!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_092#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Letting him beat you was even less of an idea. It's getting late, and he's on the run. If I kill him now, we'll be long gone by the time the others find his remains.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "But that wouldn't solve any of our problems. Once the patrol unit regroups, they'd still come looking for us. They might well be out to get revenge on us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_092#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "And yet you did it! Now what do we do!?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_092#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Calm down. They're looking for Infected. They still don't know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_092#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't know what?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_092#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "They don't know what I'm about to do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_092#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey... Talulah!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_092#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's okay. Come on, I'll walk you back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your leg there... It will need special attention to heal.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_092#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah. So today's the day you start helping me walk? Always thought I was still in good shape myself. Who'd've guessed I couldn't outrun it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "Talulah, there's something I need to tell you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_092#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What is it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_092#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_092"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, good question. Heh, hahah, sorry, I don't remember. Look at me now. Look at my memory...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's some impressive forgetfulness, alright.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
